<title>USA: Harrodsburg First Financial sets dividends.</title>
<headline>Harrodsburg First Financial sets dividends.</headline>
<dateline>HARRODSBURG, Ky. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harrodsburg First Financial Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it has set an initial semiannual cash dividend of $0.20 per share and a special cash dividend of $0.15 per share.</p>
<p>The semiannual cash dividend is to be paid October 15 to shareholders of record on September 30. The special cash dividend is to be paid October 16 to shareholders of record on October 1.</p>
<p>The company said it is its intention to continue to pay regular semiannual cash dividends.</p>
</text>
